{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁבַע","hw":"שְׁבַע","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבַע</span>]</big></big>  only <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבְעָה</span> <strong>n.f. seven (</strong>BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁבַע\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁבַע\", dir=\"rtl\">I. שֶׁבַע</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> bef. <strong>n.m.</strong> pl. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:13\" href=\"/Daniel.4.13\">Dn 4:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:22\" href=\"/Daniel.4.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:29\" href=\"/Daniel.4.29\">29</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבְעַת</span> bef. <strong>n.m.</strong> pl. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:14\" href=\"/Ezra.7.14\">Ezr 7:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַד שִׁבְעָה עַל־דִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:19\" href=\"/Daniel.3.19\">Dn 3:19</a> <em>seven times above what</em> (more than), v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, חַד\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_חַד\", dir=\"rtl\">חַד</a>, √ <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אחד\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אחד\", dir=\"rtl\">אחד</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁבַק","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁבַט"}